       "body": "Customer with name: #{_('data.ringcentral.new_call.from.name')} and number: #{_('data.ringcentral.new_call.from.phoneNumber')}-#{_('data.ringcentral.new_call.from.extensionNumber')} has #{_('data.hubspot.search_contacts.contacts.first.____Size', 'list_meta', '____Size', 'data.hubspot.search_contacts.contacts')} duplicate leads with Ids - #{_('data.utility.log_message.message')}\n\nIf needed, please reconcile the duplicate lead and rerun the job. \n\n---------------------------------------------------------\nThis is an automated notification email sent by Workato Integration App recipe. To stop receiving emails like this, please log in to your Workato account and turn Email notifications off on your recipe.\n\nJob ID : #{_('data.workato.job_context.job_id')}\nJob URL : #{_('data.workato.job_context.job_url')}\nRecipe URL : #{_('data.workato.job_context.recipe_url')}\nJob Created At : #{_('data.workato.job_context.job_created_at')}"
